 John BennettChristos Petropopoudopoulos is a New York-based stand-up comedi
 an\, viral creator\, and professional internet menace whose comedy has gene
 rated over 500 million views across social media. Drawing from his Greek an
 d Albanian roots\, years living in Japan\, and the surreal experience of be
 coming a dad in the age of the internet\, Christos blends sharp stand-up\, 
 cultural identity\, anime obsession\, and online chaos into a style that fe
 els completely unfiltered.Joe Mahoney is an NYC comic from Long Island who 
 can play to many different crowds. His clever writing has earned him countl
 ess spots at the legendary Comic Strip Live and feature work on the road. H
 e’s appeared on Adult Swim and Compound Media.John Bennett is a NYC based
  comedian from Milford Connecticut\, known for his high energy on stage and
  sharp witted observation humor. John’s comedic style involves a blend of
  personal storytelling and inherent goofiness\, with an undercurrent of con
 trolled rage. He has performed all over the US and is a local favorite amon
 g NYC comedy clubs. He currently co-produces "Tight Pants Comedy Show"\, wh
 ich has been featured in TimeOutNY and the NY Comedy Festival.\nMore info: 
